Spec: Feature Issue 1 - SBOM for each Component

Purpose:
  Generate an SBOM (a combination of SPDX and CycloneDX) for all the components in the layers:
  collector-layer, delivery-layer, maintenance-layer, and scheduler.
  The SBOMs must be placed in the respective `<Component Repository>/docs` folder.

Platform: Go/Linux

References:
  ../../../mitm-2.sdd

Owns:
  ./**

Can modify:
  /collector-layer/**
  /delivery-layer/**
  /maintenance-layer/**
  /scheduler/**
  /transformation-layer/**

Must:
  Respect the global `mitm-2` constraints defined in `.sdd` files.
  Maintain layered architecture, envelope encryption for PII, core PostgreSQL schemas, SPDX headers, English documentation, and independent `go.mod` per layer.

Tasks:
  [x] #1 Generate SBOM (SPDX and CycloneDX) for collector-layer/mitm_collector_csv-xls
  [x] #2 Generate SBOM (SPDX and CycloneDX) for collector-layer/mitm_collector_employee_ora
  [x] #3 Generate SBOM (SPDX and CycloneDX) for collector-layer/mitm_collector_employee_pg
  [x] #4 Generate SBOM (SPDX and CycloneDX) for collector-layer/mitm_collector_kafka
  [x] #5 Generate SBOM (SPDX and CycloneDX) for collector-layer/mitm_collector_ora
  [x] #6 Generate SBOM (SPDX and CycloneDX) for collector-layer/mitm_collector_pg
  [x] #7 Generate SBOM (SPDX and CycloneDX) for delivery-layer/mitm_delivery
  [x] #8 Generate SBOM (SPDX and CycloneDX) for maintenance-layer/mitm_cleanup
  [x] #9 Generate SBOM (SPDX and CycloneDX) for scheduler/mitm_scheduler
  [x] #10 Generate SBOM (SPDX and CycloneDX) for transformation-layer/mitm_transformation
  [x] #11 Update CHANGELOG.md for the affected components if required

Done when:
  SBOM with Licenses and Dependencies created for each component.
